                <invention-title lang="de">TRANSITSCHUTZEINHEIT ZUR VERWENDUNG MIT EINEM KABEL-, ROHR- ODER DRAHTÜBERGANG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">UNITÉ DE PROTECTION DE TRANSIT DESTINÉE À ÊTRE UTILISÉE AVEC UN TRANSIT DE CÂBLE, DE TUYAU OU DE FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">A TRANSIT GUARD UNIT FOR USE WITH A CABLE, PIPE OR WIRE TRANSIT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a transit guard unit (50; 50a-50n; 150; 250; 350; 450) for use with a cable, pipe or wire transit (1; 1a... 1n) which has a plurality of transit elements (10, 20, 30, 40; 42; 400) to be assembled into a sealed installation of one or more cables (2), pipes or wires at a site (5). The transit guard unit is configured to detect a condition indicative of whether the installation of the cables, pipes or wires in the transit (1) is sealed or at least potentially not sealed; transmit the detected condition via a communication interface (56) to a communication network (60; 60a) or via a short-range wireless communication interface (96) to a mobile device; receive via the communication interface (56) or via the short-range wireless communication interface (96) an instruction that a state of the transit (1) has changed to a new state; and control a status indicator unit (90; 90'; 290; 390) to cause a local indication of the new state to a user (3, 4) at the site (5).</p>
            </abstract>
